    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/prime-education-learning/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Prime Education Learning Theme is a comprehensive and versatile solution designed specifically for schools, tutors, online academies, educational institutions, e-learning platforms, coaching centers, vocational training institutes, higher education programs, primary and secondary schools, distance learning providers, STEM education centers, special education programs, early childhood education, adult education classes, and continuing education platforms. Whether you’re managing traditional classroom education, blended learning, or fully online courses, this theme caters to a variety of educational models, including online courses, skill development programs, certification programs, and professional training workshops. Its sleek and modern design allows you to effectively showcase educational programs, courses, workshops, degrees, curriculums, teaching resources, and certificates. Equipped with interactive features such as learning management system (LMS) integration, video lessons, course modules, quizzes, and education app support, it fosters an engaging learning environment for students. Customizable layouts, banners, and pre-built sections make it easy to present lesson plans, student progress, and educational content in an attractive format. With responsive design, the theme ensures seamless accessibility across devices, enabling learners and educators to stay connected anytime, anywhere. Its SEO-friendly structure and social media integration enhance visibility, attracting more students to your platform. Fully compatible with the LearnPress plugin, this theme is ideal for creating a dynamic, professional, and impactful online hub for schools, tutoring centers, academies, and e-learning platforms."
    },
